  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">שיחה בציורים - איך יודעים מיהו נביא אמת?</span></span></span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"225\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🌊 <strong data-end=\"241\" data-start=\"228\">מַּיִם</strong><span data-end=\"241\" data-start=\"228\"> (מספרים):<br /></span>פַּעַם הִגִּיעַ אֵלֵינוּ&nbsp;נָבִיא וְקָרָא: <em data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"320\">'מַיִם! הִפְכוּ לְקֶרַח!'&nbsp;</em>❄️<br />וַאֲנִי הִקְפֵּאתִי אֶת עַצְמִי כְּמוֹ פֶּסֶל!<br />הָעָם מָחָא כַּפַּיִם - אֲבָל רָאִיתִי שֶׁהֵם לֹא מַאֲמִינִים מַמָּשׁ.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"485\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🔥 <strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"488\">אֵשׁ </strong><span data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"488\">(מתלהבת):<br /></span>וַאֲנִי, לְפִי צִוּוּיוֹ, הָפַכְתִּי לְעוּגַת שׁוֹקוֹלָד חַמָּה!!!<br />מָה תַּגִּידוּ עַל זֶה?</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"659\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💨 <strong data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"662\">רוּחַ </strong><span data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"662\">(לוחשת):<br /></span><span data-end=\"754\" data-start=\"690\">זֶה בֶּאֱמֶת נִפְלָא,&nbsp;</span>אֲבָל אֵין כָּאן הוֹכָחָה. זֶה סְתָם מוֹפֵת כְּמוֹ קֶסֶם.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"765\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌦️ <strong data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"769\">גֶּשֶׁם </strong><span data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"769\">(נזכר):</span> <br />אָז בָּא נָבִיא אַחֵר. הוּא חִיֵּךְ אֵלַי וְאָמַר: <br /><em data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"836\">'מָחָר, בְּשָׁעָה עֶשֶׂר, אַתָּה תֵּרֵד לְהַשְׁקוֹת אֶת&nbsp;הַחִטִּים 🌾'.<br />'וּמָחָר בְּשָׁעָה עֶשֶׂר וָרֶבַע תֵּרָאֶה קֶשֶׁת בֶּעָנָן&nbsp;</em></span>🌈<em data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"836\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">'.<br /></em><span data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"993\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבֶאֱמֶת, לְמָחֳרָת זֶה קָרָה בְּדִיּוּק בַּשָּׁעוֹת שֶׁהוּא אָמַר </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⏳.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"765\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📜 </span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">הרמב\"ם</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"> (מקריא):</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זֶה סִימָן שֶׁהוּא נְבִיא אֱמֶת!</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1144\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌩️ <strong data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1148\">סְּעָרָה </strong><span data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1148\">(שואלת):<br /></span>פַּעַם אַחַת, צִוָּה עָלַי&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נָבִיא,</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לִנְשֹׁב בִּפְרָאוּת&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌪️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלַעֲקֹר אֶת כָּל הָעֵצִים&nbsp;</span>🌲<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">, <br />אֲבָל לֹא שָׁמַעְתִּי בְּקוֹלוֹ. <br />זֶה סִימָן שֶׁהוּא נָבִיא שֶׁקֶר?</span></span></p><p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"765\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📜&nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">הרמב\"ם</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;(ממשיך להקריא):</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זֶה לֹא סִימָן שֶׁהוּא שַׁקְרָן.<br />אִם הָעָם חָזַר בִּתְשׁוּבָה - הַשֵּׁם בִּטֵּל אֶת הַגְּזֵרָה שֶׁל הַסְּעָרָה.<br /></span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"1874\" data-start=\"1593\"></p>\n<p data-end=\"2066\" data-start=\"1881\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">✡️<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1907\" data-start=\"1884\">נָּבִיא זָּקֵן </strong><span data-end=\"1907\" data-start=\"1884\">(אמיתי):</span> <br />תֵּדְעוּ לָכֶם, יִצְחָק, הַתַּלְמִיד שֶׁלִּי - גַּם הוּא נָבִיא אֱמֶת.</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"2239\" data-start=\"2068\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌾 </span><strong data-end=\"2257\" data-start=\"2244\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַחִטָּה</strong><span data-end=\"2257\" data-start=\"2244\" style=\"font-family: arial;\"> (מסכימה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ נַאֲמִין לוֹ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִיָּד - בְּלִי בְּדִיקָה, כִּי נָּבִיא אֲמִתִּי הֵעִיד עָלָיו.</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"2562\" data-start=\"2384\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🐜 <strong data-end=\"2402\" data-start=\"2387\">נְּמָלָה </strong><span data-end=\"2402\" data-start=\"2387\">(מסכמת):</span> <br />הָעִקָּר הוּא לֹא לִפְנוֹת לְמוֹפְתִים וּלְקִסְמִים, אֶלָּא לְמִי שֶׁדְּבָרָיו מִתְקַיְּמִים בְּדִיּוּק - וְשֶׁהוּא הוֹלֵךְ בְּדַרְכֵי ה'.</span></p><p data-end=\"2562\" data-start=\"2384\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מלכותית</span></span></h2></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🔍</strong><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;הדברים הטובים והרעים של המלך:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִשְׁנֶה,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תּוֹרָה,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּסֵּא,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: arial;\">סוּסִים, כֶּסֶף, זָהָב</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: arial;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נָשִׁים.</span></span></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></span></div><br style=\"background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\" /><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi9FR4aC3k96mr7JcxcjYV80zMF8ZX-W0rMX48hwsFvYESGVzMfy_gxlqUeaIzunpveArgLoz11aKFRd-vFp7RZYXIsYR0JvIs-uSonMaGqmvFb05so47GaNb6ZCUjmu4xIliUqMGkJIzeI1T_v5KBhoXSZ0ZAapHP6akc2OkIprkwDSF8pdd2ZF7P_k5o/s464/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"450\" data-original-width=\"464\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi9FR4aC3k96mr7JcxcjYV80zMF8ZX-W0rMX48hwsFvYESGVzMfy_gxlqUeaIzunpveArgLoz11aKFRd-vFp7RZYXIsYR0JvIs-uSonMaGqmvFb05so47GaNb6ZCUjmu4xIliUqMGkJIzeI1T_v5KBhoXSZ0ZAapHP6akc2OkIprkwDSF8pdd2ZF7P_k5o/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></div><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\" style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></span></h2></span></div><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p></span></div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><p data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"93\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה מְצַוָּה לְמַנּוֹת שׁוֹפְטִים?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"172\"><p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"175\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם רוֹצִים לָדַעַת אֶת הֶעָתִיד - כְּדַאי לִשְׁאֹל קוֹסְמִים?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"172\"><p data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"175\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַיָּל שֶׁנּוֹלַד לוֹ תִּינוֹק - לֹא צָרִיךְ לְהִלָּחֵם?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"365\" data-start=\"270\"><p data-end=\"365\" data-start=\"273\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֶלֶךְ יִשְׂרָאֵל צָרִיךְ לִכְתֹּב לוֹ סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"440\" data-start=\"366\"><p data-end=\"440\" data-start=\"369\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַמֶּלֶךְ מֻתָּר לְהַרְבּוֹת לוֹ נָשִׁים וְסוּסִים כְּכָל שֶׁיַרְצֶה?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"441\"><p data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"444\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נָבִיא אֱמֶת לֹא צָרִיךְ לַעֲשׂוֹת נֵס כְּמוֹ מֹשֶׁה, אֶלָּא לְדַבֵּר דְּבָרִים שֶׁיִּתְקַיְּמוּ?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"615\"><p data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"618\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם נָבִיא מְדַבֵּר בְּשֵׁם אֱלֹהִים אֲחֵרִים - הוּא נָבִיא שֶׁקֶר?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"615\"><p data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"618\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֻתָּר לַעֲקֹר עֵץ תַּפּוּזִים כְּדֵי לִבְנוֹת מָצוֹר עַל עִיר?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"688\"><p data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"691\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָעָם</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;יוֹצֵא לְמִלְחָמָה - הַכֹּהֵן מְלַמֵּד אוֹתָם תַּכְסִיסִים?</span></span></p></li><li data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"688\"><p data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"691\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם מָצְאוּ מֵת בֵּין עָרִים - הָעִיר הֲכִי קְרוֹבָה צְרִיכָה לְהָבִיא עֶגְלָה עֲרוּפָה?</span></p></li></ol>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
}
